{"seq":2,"slug":"single-stage-detectors","title":"单阶段检测器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/object-detection/single-stage-detectors","wordCount":1345,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"单阶段检测器\">单阶段检测器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>单阶段检测器（Single-Stage Detectors）跳过候选区域生成步骤，直接在特征图上回归目标的类别和位置。这种端到端的设计大幅简化了检测流水线，带来了显著的速度优势。YOLO 系列和 SSD 是单阶段检测器的两大代表，前者强调极致速度，后者强调多尺度检测。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[输入图像] --&gt; B[骨干网络]&#10;    B --&gt; C[特征金字塔]&#10;    C --&gt; D[密集预测头]&#10;    D --&gt; E[类别预测]&#10;    D --&gt; F[框回归]&#10;    D --&gt; G[目标置信度]&#10;    E --&gt; H[NMS 后处理]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[最终检测结果]\">graph LR\n    A[输入图像] --&gt; B[骨干网络]\n    B --&gt; C[特征金字塔]\n    C --&gt; D[密集预测头]\n    D --&gt; E[类别预测]\n    D --&gt; F[框回归]\n    D --&gt; G[目标置信度]\n    E --&gt; H[NMS 后处理]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[最终检测结果]</pre><p>单阶段检测器的核心思想是将目标检测视为密集预测问题：在特征图的每个位置上预测固定数量的锚框或关键点的类别和偏移。这种设计避免了两阶段方法中 RoI 提取的计算开销，同时能够利用 GPU 的并行计算优势。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>发布年份</th>\n<th>COCO mAP</th>\n<th>FPS (V100)</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>核心特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SSD</td>\n<td>2016</td>\n<td>25.1</td>\n<td>120+</td>\n<td>26M</td>\n<td>多尺度特征图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YOLOv3</td>\n<td>2018</td>\n<td>33.0</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>62M</td>\n<td>Darknet-53 + FPN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RetinaNet</td>\n<td>2017</td>\n<td>37.8</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>37M</td>\n<td>Focal Loss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YOLOv5</td>\n<td>2020</td>\n<td>48.2</td>\n<td>140</td>\n<td>47M</td>\n<td>工程优化集大成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YOLOv8</td>\n<td>2023</td>\n<td>52.9</td>\n<td>130</td>\n<td>44M</td>\n<td>解耦头 + 无锚框</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"yolo-系列演进\">YOLO 系列演进</h2><p>YOLO（You Only Look Once）是目标检测历史上最具影响力的系列工作。YOLOv1 将检测看作单次回归问题，将图像划分为 S×S 的网格，每个网格负责预测落在其中的目标。虽然 YOLOv1 的精度不如同期的 Faster R-CNN，但其速度快了数倍，开创了实时目标检测的先河。</p>\n<p>YOLOv3 引入了多尺度检测：在三个不同分辨率的特征图上进行预测，分别检测大、中、小目标。它使用 Darknet-53 作为骨干网络，结合类似 FPN 的自顶向下融合路径，显著提升了小目标检测能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from ultralytics import YOLO&#10;&#10;model = YOLO(&quot;yolov8n.pt&quot;)&#10;&#10;results = model(&quot;image.jpg&quot;)&#10;for result in results:&#10;    boxes = result.boxes&#10;    for box in boxes:&#10;        cls = int(box.cls[0])&#10;        conf = float(box.conf[0])&#10;        xyxy = box.xyxy[0].tolist()&#10;        print(f&quot;类别: {cls}, 置信度: {conf:.2f}, 框: {xyxy}&quot;)&#10;&#10;model.train(data=&quot;coco128.yaml&quot;, epochs=100, imgsz=640, batch=16)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ultralytics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> YOLO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> YOLO(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yolov8n.pt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image.jpg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    boxes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.boxes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> box </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boxes:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        cls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(box.cls[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        conf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(box.conf[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        xyxy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> box.xyxy[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].tolist()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"类别: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{cls}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, 置信度: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">conf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, 框: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xyxy</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.train(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"coco128.yaml\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">epochs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">imgsz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">640</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph YOLO 演进&#10;        A[YOLOv1 2016] --&gt; B[YOLOv2 2017]&#10;        B --&gt; C[YOLOv3 2018]&#10;        C --&gt; D[YOLOv4 2020]&#10;        D --&gt; E[YOLOv5 2020]&#10;        E --&gt; F[YOLOv8 2023]&#10;        F --&gt; G[YOLOv11 2024]&#10;        G --&gt; H[YOLO12 2025]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 关键改进&#10;        H2[网格预测] --&gt; I2[多尺度检测]&#10;        I2 --&gt; J2[Mosaic增强+CSP]&#10;        J2 --&gt; K2[解耦头+无锚框]&#10;        K2 --&gt; L2[注意力中心化]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph YOLO 演进\n        A[YOLOv1 2016] --&gt; B[YOLOv2 2017]\n        B --&gt; C[YOLOv3 2018]\n        C --&gt; D[YOLOv4 2020]\n        D --&gt; E[YOLOv5 2020]\n        E --&gt; F[YOLOv8 2023]\n        F --&gt; G[YOLOv11 2024]\n        G --&gt; H[YOLO12 2025]\n    end\n    subgraph 关键改进\n        H2[网格预测] --&gt; I2[多尺度检测]\n        I2 --&gt; J2[Mosaic增强+CSP]\n        J2 --&gt; K2[解耦头+无锚框]\n        K2 --&gt; L2[注意力中心化]\n    end</pre><p>YOLOv5 是工程化程度最高的版本，提供了从 nano 到 xlarge 五种模型尺寸，内置了完善的训练流水线、数据增强和部署工具。YOLOv8 进一步引入了解耦检测头（分类和回归使用独立的分支）和无锚框设计，在速度和精度上都达到了新的高度。此后系列仍在快速演进：YOLO11（2024）延续该设计并继续改进精度-速度权衡；YOLOv12（2025，arXiv:2502.12524）转向以注意力为中心的架构；Ultralytics 于 2025 年下半年发布的 YOLO26 则主打端到端 NMS-free 推理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ssd-与多尺度检测\">SSD 与多尺度检测</h2><p>SSD（Single Shot MultiBox Detector）的核心创新是在骨干网络的多个层级上直接进行检测。浅层特征图分辨率高，负责检测小目标；深层特征图分辨率低但感受野大，负责检测大目标。这种金字塔式的多尺度检测策略被后续的检测器广泛采用。</p>\n<p>SSD 在 VGG-16 的基础上添加了额外的卷积层，形成逐渐缩小的特征图序列。每个特征图上的每个位置都放置多个不同宽高比的默认框（类似锚框），通过 3×3 卷积预测每个默认框的类别和偏移。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torchvision&#10;from torchvision.models.detection import ssd300_vgg16&#10;&#10;model = ssd300_vgg16(weights=torchvision.models.detection.SSD300_VGG16_Weights.COCO_V1)&#10;model.eval()&#10;&#10;dummy_image = torch.randn(3, 300, 300)&#10;with torch.no_grad():&#10;    predictions = model([dummy_image])&#10;    print(f&quot;SSD 检测到 {len(predictions[0][&#39;boxes&#39;])} 个目标&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision.models.detection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ssd300_vgg16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ssd300_vgg16(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torchvision.models.detection.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SSD300_VGG16_Weights</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COCO_V1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.eval()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dummy_image </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    predictions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model([dummy_image])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SSD 检测到 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(predictions[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'boxes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 个目标\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DSSD（Deconvolutional SSD）在 SSD 的基础上添加了自顶向下的反卷积路径，将高层语义信息融合到低层特征中，改善了小目标的检测效果。Feature Pyramid Networks（FPN）进一步将这种多尺度融合方式标准化，成为现代检测器的基础组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"focal-loss-与正负样本均衡\">Focal Loss 与正负样本均衡</h2><p>RetinaNet 的核心贡献是 Focal Loss，它解决了单阶段检测器面临的严重类别不均衡问题。在密集预测中，大量的背景位置（负样本）远多于目标位置（正样本），导致训练被简单负样本主导，模型无法有效学习困难样本的特征。</p>\n<p>Focal Loss 通过在标准交叉熵损失前添加调制因子 <code>(1-p_t)^γ</code> 来降低容易分类样本的损失权重。当 γ=2 时，一个置信度为 0.9 的正确分类样本的损失权重仅为标准交叉熵的 1%，而困难样本的损失权重几乎不变。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;class FocalLoss(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, alpha=0.25, gamma=2.0):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.alpha = alpha&#10;        self.gamma = gamma&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, inputs, targets):&#10;        bce_loss = F.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits(inputs, targets, reduction=&#39;none&#39;)&#10;        p_t = torch.exp(-bce_loss)&#10;        focal_weight = self.alpha * (1 - p_t) ** self.gamma&#10;        loss = focal_weight * bce_loss&#10;        return loss.mean()&#10;&#10;focal_loss = FocalLoss(alpha=0.25, gamma=2.0)&#10;logits = torch.randn(100, 80)&#10;targets = torch.zeros(100, 80)&#10;targets[0, 5] = 1.0&#10;loss = focal_loss(logits, targets)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FocalLoss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gamma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.gamma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gamma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, inputs, targets):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        bce_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits(inputs, targets, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reduction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        p_t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.exp(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bce_loss)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        focal_weight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_t) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.gamma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> focal_weight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bce_loss</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss.mean()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">focal_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FocalLoss(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gamma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">targets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.zeros(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">targets[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> focal_loss(logits, targets)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Focal Loss</td>\n<td>动态降低简单样本权重</td>\n<td>显著提升 AP</td>\n<td>通用密集检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OHEM</td>\n<td>在线困难样本挖掘</td>\n<td>中等提升</td>\n<td>两阶段检测器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GHM</td>\n<td>梯度和谐机制</td>\n<td>稳定训练</td>\n<td>梯度不均衡场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ATSS</td>\n<td>自适应正样本选择</td>\n<td>消除锚框敏感性</td>\n<td>通用检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ATSS（Adaptive Training Sample Selection）发现正样本的选择策略比锚框设计更重要。它根据锚框与真实框的 IoU 分布自适应地确定正负样本划分阈值，消除了锚框超参数对性能的影响，统一了有锚框和无锚框检测器的性能差距。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((单阶段检测器))&#10;    YOLO 系列&#10;      YOLOv1 网格预测&#10;      YOLOv3 多尺度&#10;      YOLOv8 解耦头&#10;    SSD 系列&#10;      多层级检测&#10;      默认框&#10;      DSSD 反卷积&#10;    训练技巧&#10;      Focal Loss&#10;      ATSS 自适应选择&#10;      Mosaic 增强\">mindmap\n  root((单阶段检测器))\n    YOLO 系列\n      YOLOv1 网格预测\n      YOLOv3 多尺度\n      YOLOv8 解耦头\n    SSD 系列\n      多层级检测\n      默认框\n      DSSD 反卷积\n    训练技巧\n      Focal Loss\n      ATSS 自适应选择\n      Mosaic 增强</pre><ul>\n<li>单阶段检测器通过密集预测实现了远超两阶段方法的推理速度</li>\n<li>YOLO 系列持续迭代至 YOLO11、YOLO12 与 YOLO26，每一代都在速度-精度权衡上继续改进</li>\n<li>SSD 开创了多尺度检测范式，其思想被 FPN 标准化并广泛采用</li>\n<li>Focal Loss 有效解决了正负样本严重不均衡问题，是单阶段检测器训练的关键</li>\n<li>ATSS 证明了正样本选择策略比锚框设计更重要</li>\n<li>实际部署中，Ultralytics 框架（覆盖 YOLOv8 至 YOLO26）提供了完善的训练和部署工具链</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"单阶段检测器","id":"单阶段检测器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"YOLO 系列演进","id":"yolo-系列演进"},{"level":2,"text":"SSD 与多尺度检测","id":"ssd-与多尺度检测"},{"level":2,"text":"Focal Loss 与正负样本均衡","id":"focal-loss-与正负样本均衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"两阶段检测器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/object-detection/two-stage-detectors"},"next":{"title":"无锚框检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/object-detection/anchor-free-detection"}}